IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sca-spent`

-- Spent Convictions Act 1988 (WA), ss 3, 4, 6-12, 14, 15, 17-28, 30, 32, Schedules 1-3 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or the Spent Convictions Regulations 1992 (not deposited).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_spent-convictions-act-1988_baseline.py).
-- Expected results were written by hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-jake (Jake born 30 August 2006; the shop theft on
-- 20 November 2021, referred by police to a juvenile justice team, no charge and no conviction; a security officer's
-- licence from 2034). The other fixtures are hypothetical comparators.

§ `fixtures`

