#ASSERT `Is my conviction spent` `a fine of $500 in 2021, certificate issued`
#ASSERT `Is my conviction spent` `18 months in 2010, ordered spent by a judge`
#ASSERT `Is my conviction spent` `a Queensland conviction spent under Queensland law`
#ASSERT NOT `Is my conviction spent` `a Victorian conviction spent under Victorian law`
#ASSERT `Is my conviction spent` `a certificate-spent fine, parole on another sentence later cancelled`

